# funkysi1701.com (Hugo blog)

Hugo blog/portfolio on **Azure Static Web Apps**. Theme: frozen **hugo-theme-bootstrap v0.65.1** — prefer root `layouts/`, `assets/`, `static/` over editing `themes/`.

**Start here:** [`docs/AI_CONTEXT.md`](../../docs/AI_CONTEXT.md) — tool map, non-negotiables, OpenSpec vs small fixes, anti-patterns. Commands and CI: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md). PR checklist: [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md). Slim Copilot: [`.github/copilot-instructions.md`](../../.github/copilot-instructions.md).

## Repo layout (quick)

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `content/` | Posts (`posts/YYYY/`) and pages |
| `layouts/`, `assets/`, `static/` | Site overrides (not the vendored theme) |
| `config/` | `_default` + development / staging / production |
| `tests/`, `specs/` | Playwright E2E + scenario plan |
| `scripts/`, `.github/workflows/` | Automation and CI |

## Scoped Cursor rules

| Rule file | When it loads |
|-----------|----------------|
| `content-posts.mdc` | `content/posts/**` |
| `playwright-tests.mdc` | `tests/**` |
| `hugo-layouts.mdc` | `layouts/**` |
| `parkrun-generated.mdc` | parkrun content / scraper |

## Non-negotiables (summary)

1. Posts: `draft = false`; review on **blog-dev** (`feature/*` / `develop`), not Hugo `draft = true`.
2. British English; SEO title/description length gates (`npm run check:meta`).
3. Do not edit `public/` or the parkrun generated block.
4. No secrets in git; no SPA `navigationFallback` → `/index.html` (`npm run check:swa-config`).
5. Keep docs (`AGENTS.md`, README, CONTRIBUTING, rules, Copilot) in sync when behaviour changes.
6. Smallest change that satisfies the task.

**OpenSpec** for medium/large work: `/opsx-propose` → apply → archive (`openspec/config.yaml`). Skills: [`.cursor/skills/`](../skills/). Hooks: [`.cursor/hooks/README.md`](../hooks/README.md).
